        <Position x="118" y="212" width="1020" height="84" />
      </GuiSettings>
      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <Text>The Online Retail Sales file contains sales data from an online store from 2017-2019. Each record contains the aggregate sales of one product type for a single day. Our task is to use summary statistics to develop a better understanding of the online sales during that time period.</Text>
